Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:32.24,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.333,185.466)}Episode 12
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:32.24,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an8\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.866,280.399)}And The One She Chooses Is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:41.22,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,A being that can kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:43.58,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Perhaps that was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:48.57,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Maybe I did long for that for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:50.90,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.13,0:01:55.73,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It's not a lie that I was \Ntrying to resurrect Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:02:00.97,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I have kept on living \Nso I could see Shin one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:04.33,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,But as you said:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:08.51,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,"Is the man I gave birth to truly Shin?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:10.66,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,That doubt lingered in part of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:17.17,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Though I had no idea \Nwhat else I was supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:21.20,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:25.39,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Perhaps I truly did want to die all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:33.95,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,How did I never realize \Nsomething so simple before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.43,0:02:42.33,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If you came to kiss me \Nwhile understanding all of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:47.66,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,then that means \Nyou intend to kill me, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:51.69,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:56.69,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Is that what you thought I'd say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:02:57.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:02.62,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't have the nerves \Nof steel you've shown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:05.27,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm not going to shoulder \Nthe burden of your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:07.42,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,You see, Mio,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:11.96,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,I came here to steal you away from Shinji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:17.98,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Right now all ten sephirah reside within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.98,0:03:20.84,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,I can probably seal away \Nyour Spirit power as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:24.54,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,But sealing you shouldn't equal death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:27.23,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Not as long as you don't choose death yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.17,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,So with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.93,0:03:38.79,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Forget about your old love \Nand come hook up with me, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:52.09,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What was that? \NThat doesn't suit you at all, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:54.96,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Are you even being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:57.89,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,S-Setting aside whether that suited me or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.89,0:03:59.05,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:01.84,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,I genuinely intend to \Nsteal you away from Shinji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.47,0:04:04.62,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:09.47,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,That's what he says, \Nbut what do you think, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:12.25,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Am I allowed to say something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:15.85,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I'm just something separated \Nfrom Shido's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.85,0:04:18.86,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I'm basically an imitation of an imitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:22.97,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,But your memories are those of Shin's, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:24.13,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,So speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:28.37,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Whatever you're thinking should be \Nthe same as what the real Shinji would.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:32.13,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I might just get \Nstolen away by Shido, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.81,0:04:34.87,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:38.66,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,In that case, I will speak my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:41.76,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Screw you, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:42.85,Main - Top,Shido,0,0,0,,O-Oh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.68,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,You keep saying whatever you \Ndamn well please while I hold my tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.47,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,But even I can't forgive you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:53.25,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I'm never handing Mio over to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:58.49,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,So yeah, that's how I would feel \Nwere I still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:00.11,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Though...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.42,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I don't exist anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:08.13,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Honestly, the thought of Mio \Nchoosing anyone other than me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:10.18,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,makes my heart feel like it'll burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:14.67,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,But even so, I don't want Mio \Nto choose death either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:19.67,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,There were still so many things \Nin this world that I wanted to show Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.51,0:05:24.14,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,This ocean is pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:27.97,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I'm really glad I got to bring Mio here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:29.58,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.13,0:05:32.77,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,it's about time she visits somewhere else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:35.45,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:38.73,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I've kept you tied down for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:45.21,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:49.57,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Shido, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:53.06,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:54.66,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Reine, is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:56.56,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,Interference from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:58.97,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,It's most likely the Spirit Formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.97,0:06:00.50,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Spirit Formula?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.95,0:06:06.55,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,The formula once used to create \Na Spirit, meaning me, in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:08.43,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,It's a secret magic ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:13.81,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,As far as I know, the only one \Ncapable of activating it is Westcott.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:15.06,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:19.75,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Are you saying they're trying \Nto give birth to a new Spirit outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:20.99,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It would seem so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:23.97,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,He wants another Spirit of Origin like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:28.85,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,And this time it looks like Westcott \Nis at the center of that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:34.02,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,Apparently he's trying to use himself \Nas a core while activating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:40.06,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,You mean Westcott is trying to \Ngain the power of a Spirit of Origin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.06,0:06:41.46,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,The same level of power Mio wields?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:42.86,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:48.34,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,A massive flow of Spirit Power \Nis already gathered here in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:54.07,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,Westcott intends to use this flow \Nto make himself a Spirit of Origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:59.26,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,He doesn't even need all ten sephirah anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:03.48,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,since he can just use the power \Nmanifested here as-is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:07.65,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Maybe that's what Westcott \Nwas planning from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:08.77,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:12.11,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,He probably knew about \Nthe situation ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:14.25,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:17.74,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,He was able to learn about what \NI experienced in the future through Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:23.18,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,No, if anything is responsible \Nfor causing this, then that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:27.01,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,Besides, we don't have time to be \Nregretting things right now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:28.51,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:32.00,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I refuse to be used by that man,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:35.67,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,and letting him overwrite the world that holds \Nmy memories with Shin would be even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:38.49,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Shido, lend me your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:42.85,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I know this might sound strange coming from me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.85,0:07:44.98,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,after I killed all the Spirits in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:47.75,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,but let's go save everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:49.46,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.37,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:52.11,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:54.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:57.47,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mhmm, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:07:59.29,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:00.43,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:05.04,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Uhh, then pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:08.18,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,Thank you for the ultimate date.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:10.05,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:12.47,Default,Reine,0,0,0,,I know you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.67,0:08:18.47,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:19.62,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:33.24,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:33.24,Main - Top,Girls,0,0,0,,Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:33.24,Main - Top,Girls,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.49,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.49,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:35.57,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:35.57,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.57,0:08:36.49,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:38.49,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:42.50,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Hey, Isaac Westcott.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:47.25,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,It looks like you've really had your way \Nwith things while we were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:51.50,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,I'm grateful to you, Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:58.69,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,After all, you're the one who kept \NDeus in place while I activated my formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:02.39,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Belial!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:15.86,Default,Kotori,0,0,0,,Belial?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:17.74,Default,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's a Demon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:22.24,Default,Kurumi,0,0,0,,One with power on par with Mio's Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:26.64,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido, that's!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:31.18,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,He's planning to fundamentally \Nrewrite this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:33.51,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:35.05,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Ein Sof.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:45.78,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.78,0:09:47.31,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I can't hold this for long!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:50.60,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Everyone, please, lend me your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:54.32,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,So I can protect this world where I met Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:58.74,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:06.98,Default,Nia,0,0,0,,Oh! Is this—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.15,0:10:11.00,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Still, we're up against another Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:15.49,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,We'll need to coalesce everyone's \Npower in order to fully defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:18.38,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Coalesce our power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:20.18,Default,Kotori,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:23.02,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,He's right here, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:26.91,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The one man who can \Nwield the power of all the Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:31.65,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Here we go, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:33.19,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,To save the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:38.82,Default,Ellen,0,0,0,,You think I'd let you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:39.70,Default,Artemisia,0,0,0,,We won't let you through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:54.63,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Belial!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:56.59,Default,Miku,0,0,0,,Gabriel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:02.59,Default,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Use this power as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:05.26,Default,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel, Aleph!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:11.10,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Halvanhelv!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:20.49,Default,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Michael, Siffleur!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:25.19,Default,Kotori,0,0,0,,Camael!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:38.05,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:41.14,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,How about this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:42.43,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Athiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.14,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,That's!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:52.02,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.29,Default,Nia,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:12:00.41,Default,Nia,0,0,0,,You can rest easy \Nnow that I'm back in business!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:04.44,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Well done, Nia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.44,0:12:08.79,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I've raised your usefulness rating \Nfrom paramecium to water flea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:10.05,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,That voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.05,0:12:11.66,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Are you Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:15.88,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Yes. I've obtained my long-awaited real body,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.67,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,and now I'm the perfect Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:22.81,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Nibeelcole was a pseudo-Spirit \Ncreated by Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.81,0:12:27.18,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,So there's no reason \Nthe same couldn't be done with Raziel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:31.34,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Of course, the individual units \Nhit with Athiel's power can't be resurrected,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:34.09,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,but it's possible for me \Nto protect you all with this body,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:36.31,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,even if only for a brief time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:38.40,Default,Nia,0,0,0,,Go, Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:40.15,Default,Nia,0,0,0,,I choose you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:42.69,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Maria won't obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:43.82,Default,Nia,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:48.37,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Now, leave your defense to me and go, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:50.95,Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Go put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:52.16,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:12:57.46,Default,Origami,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:12:59.10,Default,Nia,0,0,0,,Raziel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:02.91,Default,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:05.84,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:07.97,Default,Kotori,0,0,0,,Camael!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:11.13,Default,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:13.89,Default,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:15.87,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:18.17,Default,Miku,0,0,0,,Gabriel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.57,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:26.10,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Go, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:26.95,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:28.99,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Shido Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:57.50,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Splendidly done, Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.45,0:14:02.21,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,But you were one step shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:03.02,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:05.91,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Qemetiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:12.85,Default,Spirits,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:12.85,Default,Spirits,0,0,0,,Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:12.85,Default,Spirits,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:12.85,Main - Top,Spirits,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:12.85,Main - Top,Spirits,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:13.79,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.29,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You can't, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:24.68,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:27.92,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You have all those girls waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:31.00,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,His Spirit Power is out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:34.89,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If we leave that alone, \Nit'll blow away the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.93,0:14:40.20,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,But if I use my Ein to cancel it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:42.58,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,then I might be able to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:43.75,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:46.24,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,But if you do that, then you'll—!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.03,0:14:50.41,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Even Shinji said it to you, didn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:52.95,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,He wanted you to see more of this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:55.16,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,So why would you—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.09,0:15:00.97,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Shido, you really are wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:03.14,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I do love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:09.21,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Just second to Shinji, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:18.94,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:34.14,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Deus, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:37.83,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,What a luxury to have you watch over my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.01,0:15:43.27,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sure we don't belong in the world to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:48.07,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Neither you nor I.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:55.22,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,I wonder why I was never able to obtain you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:16:00.01,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You should never have created \Na Spirit in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:04.49,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,This power is too much for mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:09.77,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Though, well, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:13.74,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,if there were some misfortune \Nin addition to that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:17.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,then it would be that you weren't my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:26.13,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:28.15,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Nothing I could do about that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:35.76,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Qemetiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:37.34,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Ein.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:58.22,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,This was for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:01.79,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I was too late in realizing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:08.09,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,but at least I managed to protect Shido \Nand everyone else in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:12.62,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:15.12,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:21.87,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:24.37,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I've kept you waiting for an awfully long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.78,0:17:27.10,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:29.36,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin! Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:30.57,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:33.11,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,I've missed you for so, so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:36.11,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I've missed you for so long, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:39.18,Default,Shinji,0,0,0,,From now on, we'll be together forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:39.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:53.33,Default,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:57.51,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Hey, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:00.94,Default,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike, look at what's happened to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:03.26,Default,Ellen,0,0,0,,We need to get you into \Na medical realizer quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:04.83,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:10.65,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,I got caught up in an Angel and a Demon King \Ncanceling each other out at close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:14.40,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's a miracle I'm even still conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:16.79,Default,Woodman,0,0,0,,Ike...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:21.77,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Hey, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.79,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Karen, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:28.25,Default,Ellen,0,0,0,,Please, Elliot! Save Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:29.79,Default,Ellen,0,0,0,,You can do it, can't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:31.54,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Elliot...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:34.57,Default,Woodman,0,0,0,,I would if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:36.75,Default,Woodman,0,0,0,,But he's already...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:45.57,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,So what brought you all the way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.57,0:18:48.06,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Did you come to laugh at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.48,0:18:53.94,Default,Woodman,0,0,0,,Is it that strange that I would want \Nto see my friend when he's dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.53,0:18:58.58,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was a mean question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:02.02,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Even though our paths differed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:04.99,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,you and Karen were still my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.99,0:19:06.20,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:10.33,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,we're also two men \Nrejected by the same woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.73,0:19:13.96,Default,Woodman,0,0,0,,That's certainly true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:31.61,Default,Westcott,0,0,0,,What? It was this easy to obtain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:47.95,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido! Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.87,0:19:53.22,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:55.88,Default,Mukuro,0,0,0,,You're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:57.45,Default,Mukuro,0,0,0,,We were worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:20:02.69,Default,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Relief. Kaguya was so fraught with worry \Nshe was weeping as she clung to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.69,0:20:04.76,Default,Kaguya,0,0,0,,I never went that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:06.89,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka, where's Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:15.35,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.19,0:20:22.95,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Ahh, she rejected me in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:25.63,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Said she preferred Shin over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:27.82,Default,Kotori,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.82,0:20:29.54,Default,Kotori,0,0,0,,Nothing we can do about that then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.05,0:20:34.62,Default,Kotori,0,0,0,,I suppose this means even you weren't \Na match for that pure-love couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:39.42,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.23,0:21:29.30,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,You finally got to see Shin, huh Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:46.98,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.77,0:21:52.31,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:55.62,Default,Shido,0,0,0,,I only just got here myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.67,0:23:17.63,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,Now, Shido,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.03,0:23:19.63,Default,Tohka,0,0,0,,let's enjoy our date!
